# Configuration

## Ownership

Place parameters by actual consumers (`docs/ai/principles.md`):

- `live` — live + shared with backtest/optimizer
- `backtest` — simulation-only
- `optimize` — optimizer-only

Do not put simulation-only or optimizer-only knobs into `live` out of uncertainty.

## Privacy

Configuration is private by default. Never commit `api-keys.json`, private account configs, local host paths, or operator-only overrides.

Without case-specific approval, public examples belong only under `configs/examples/`.

## Validation

Config/schema changes need loader/default/roundtrip tests, parity across default-producing surfaces, and updates to affected example configs. See `docs/ai/validation.md`.
